sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App as Application
    participant MS as Memory Store
    participant TL as Token Limiter
    participant Sum as Summarizer
    participant Ext as Entity Extractor
    participant Ctx as Context Assembler

    User->>App: Sends new message
    App->>MS: append_turn(UserMessage)
    MS->>MS: Store in Buffer Window

    MS->>TL: check_token_limits(Buffer)
    alt Token Budget Exceeded
        TL-->>MS: Exceeded Threshold
        MS->>Sum: trigger_summarization(Oldest Turns)
        Sum-->>MS: Return Condensed Summary
        MS->>MS: Update Summary Memory
        MS->>MS: Prune Summarized Turns from Buffer
    else Under Budget
        TL-->>MS: Within Limits
    end

    MS->>Ext: extract_entities(UserMessage)
    Ext-->>MS: Return Facts/Entities
    MS->>MS: Update Entity Memory

    App->>MS: request_context()
    MS->>Ctx: assemble_prompt()

    par Fetching Context Tiers
        Ctx->>MS: Get Buffer Window Memory
        Ctx->>MS: Get Summary Memory
        Ctx->>MS: Get Relevant Entities
    end

    Ctx-->>App: Final Context Prompt
    App->>User: LLM Generated Response
